{
  "id": "E333",
  "title": "He Really Is Dead",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2019-06-07",
  "synopsis": "How do you express the moods “I knew it” and “what a surprise”? Warning: Contains spoilers for Game of Thrones season 8.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1067/d476ef34594e34bfc46ad7330106a78c9f81173b.mp3?1559201126",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "他果然死了\n\n丽丽：今天晚上就可以看新一集《权力的游戏》了，第八季真是太好看了！\n何京：是啊！你觉得这一集夜王会不会死呢？\n丽丽：肯定不会死，不然后面就没什么好看的了。\n何京：我倒不觉得，还不知道谁可以坐上铁王座呢！\n（看完以后）\n丽丽：我的妈呀！夜王竟然真的死了？\n何京：我说对了吧！他果然死了！",
    "traditional": "他果然死了\n\n麗麗：今天晚上就可以看新一集《權力的遊戲》了，第八季真是太好看了！\n何京：是啊！你覺得這一集夜王會不會死呢？\n麗麗：肯定不會死，不然後面就沒什麼好看的了。\n何京：我倒不覺得，還不知道誰可以坐上鐵王座呢！\n（看完以後）\n麗麗：我的媽呀！夜王竟然真的死了？\n何京：我說對了吧！他果然死了！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Really Is Dead"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：今天晚上就可以看新一集《权力的游戏》了，第八季真是太好看了！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：今天晚上就可以看新一集《權力的遊戲》了，第八季真是太好看了！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì jīn tiān wǎn shang jiù kě yǐ kàn xīn yì jí quán lì de yóu xì le dì bā jì zhēn shì tài hǎo kàn le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I can watch the new episode of Game of Thrones this evening, the eighth season really is very good!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "何京：是啊！你觉得这一集夜王会不会死呢？",
      "traditional": "何京：是啊！你覺得這一集夜王會不會死呢？",
      "pinyin": "hé jīng shì a nǐ jué de zhè yì jí yè wáng huì bú huì sǐ ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Jing: Yes! Do you think the Night King will die in this episode?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：肯定不会死，不然后面就没什么好看的了。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：肯定不會死，不然後面就沒什麼好看的了。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì kěn dìng bú huì sǐ bù rán hòu miàn jiù méi shén me hǎo kàn de le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: He definitely can’t die, otherwise it won’t be any interesting later."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "何京：我倒不觉得，还不知道谁可以坐上铁王座呢！",
      "traditional": "何京：我倒不覺得，還不知道誰可以坐上鐵王座呢！",
      "pinyin": "hé jīng wǒ dào bù jué de hái bù zhī dào shéi kě yǐ zuò shàng tiě wáng zuò ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Jing: I don’t think so, we still don’t know who will sit on the Iron Throne!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "（看完以后）",
      "traditional": "（看完以後）",
      "pinyin": "kàn wán yǐ hòu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "(After watching)"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我的妈呀！夜王竟然真的死了？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我的媽呀！夜王竟然真的死了？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ de mā ya yè wáng jìng rán zhēn de sǐ le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Oh my God! The Night King actually died for real?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "何京：我说对了吧！他果然死了！",
      "traditional": "何京：我說對了吧！他果然死了！",
      "pinyin": "hé jīng wǒ shuō duì le ba tā guǒ rán sǐ le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Jing: I was right! He really is dead!"
    }
  ],
